# + pf-moe-strike: FP8-direct MoE input (ZERO dequant!), FP8-direct Router, prefill_moe_qf_s8, pf_moe_native v3 (coalesced epi + cs eviction + async zero)
# + pf-comm-strike: repl_kv (34.9x less global KV wire), deferred conv sync (k_sync 17->3), bf12 RS (96.4 dB SQNR), fixed NCCL_* L2-fit Ch4+QP4+RO
